^cyan;Death^reset;
An Angel dies only when their ^green;Holy Power has completely left their body^reset;. Holy Power can be released through vigorous combat, or after a long life. Because we do not have the Cultivator with us anymore, our Holy Power ^red;WILL run out^reset;, eventually. Leading to death, but an eternity with the Cultivator ^gray;(we pray)^reset;.

When an Angel dies, their ^orange;Halo will disappear^reset;. It will fade into thin air, almost like dust. The ^orange;wings of the Angel will begin to wilt and wither

^cyan;1. Remain Faithful^reset;

We believe that a ^green;strong faith^reset; can help an Angel ^green;protect their Holy Power^reset;. Having a strong bond with the ^yellow;Cultivator^reset; and ^orange;praying at least once every week^reset; is preferred.

^cyan;2. Stay in Groups^reset;

We've noticed that ^orange;Angels who live by themselves^reset; or wander off ^orange;are more likely to join the ranks of the ^red;Ruined^reset;. As long as we ^green;stay together^reset;, we can ^green;remain strong^reset;.

^cyan;3. Stay Away From Evil^reset;

^red;Do not try to be a hero^reset; if you are not properly prepared to face such a threat as ^red;Demons^reset; or the ^red;Ruined^reset;. ^green;Leave the battles to the Guardians^reset;.

^cyan;4. Holy Water^reset;

If you ARE a Guardian, or do come in contact with any ^red;Ruined^reset; or ^red;Demons^reset;, ^green;drinking Holy Water and bathing in it^reset; is a ^orange;last resort^reset;. It can help stave off the oncoming set of symptoms that usually come with early Ruination. Or,

Mortals ^orange;typically cannot use or wield^reset; Celestial Essence in any way.
However, with the ^green;help of a powerful Angel^reset;, Mortals ^yellow;may be able to learn the holy ways of Angelic crafting^reset;...
^gray;(Note: Not implemented yet. But the lore is true!)^reset;

Upon studying them I ^orange;tried^reset; to find a way to cure them..^green;to bring them back to the light^reset;. No matter what I tried or said, ^red;nothing seemed to work^reset;. They would still swing their sword at me, a fellow Angel!

I fear these are dark times indeed.
-^yellow;Unknown Angel^reset;

